00:00:59.239 --> 00:01:03.520
Speaker 2: Have you received the vaccine yet
now that it's widely available to anybody

00:01:03.520 --> 00:01:04.520
in the US?

00:01:04.520 --> 00:01:05.520
Do you plan to?

00:01:05.520 --> 00:01:06.529
