00:01:06.529 --> 00:01:10.069
Naturally, there's about one hundred million
Americans who have had it.

00:01:10.069 --> 00:01:14.719
Naturally, all the scientific evidence, all
of the studies have shown that there is long

00:01:14.719 --> 00:01:16.759
lasting immunity from having it.

00:01:16.759 --> 00:01:21.110
Naturally, if people want to get vaccinated,
if they're older, it's not an unreasonable

00:01:21.110 --> 00:01:22.110
thing.

00:01:22.110 --> 00:01:26.409
But I think for people in my age range and
younger who have had it, I think the vaccine

00:01:26.409 --> 00:01:27.409
