00:01:30.889 --> 00:01:34.530
So at this point, yes, I don't think there's
enough evidence leading me to think that I

00:01:34.530 --> 00:01:37.439
need to be vaccinated since I've already had
the disease naturally.

00:01:37.439 --> 00:01:45.409
Now, unfortunately, there is a lot at least
probably wrong with what Rand Paul is saying.

00:01:45.409 --> 00:01:50.560
It's important to mention a lot of the things
Rand Paul is claiming to know for sure are

00:01:50.560 --> 00:01:55.499
sort of open questions, but we have more and
more information that points actually the

00:01:55.499 --> 00:01:56.499
other way.

00:01:56.499 --> 00:02:00.130
So there are some extensive antibody tests
that have been done.

00:02:00.130 --> 00:02:05.909
And first and foremost, it does appear that
the immunity you get from a vaccine lasts

00:02:05.909 --> 00:02:10.780
longer than the immunity you get from recovering
from coronavirus.

00:02:10.780 --> 00:02:14.709
Naturally, many studies and papers have found
this.

00:02:14.709 --> 00:02:18.590
We're showing a screenshot of one of them
to our video audience right now.

00:02:18.590 --> 00:02:23.950
So, in other words, there's a reason why people
are being told, even if you've recovered from

00:02:23.950 --> 00:02:29.530
the virus still, go ahead and get yourself
vaccinated, because it appears as though we

00:02:29.530 --> 00:02:32.430
