00:02:32.430 --> 00:02:38.060
It appears as though the immunity is longer
lasting and more robust from the vaccine than

00:02:38.060 --> 00:02:40.459
from just getting the virus and recovering.

00:02:40.459 --> 00:02:45.760
Now, second, again, from what we know so far
and much of this is still being studied, but

00:02:45.760 --> 00:02:47.019
why take a chance?

00:02:47.019 --> 00:02:52.100
It is less likely, it appears less likely
that the variants will get around vaccine

00:02:52.100 --> 00:02:56.180
induced immunity than natural recovery immunity.

00:02:56.180 --> 00:03:02.900
In other words, the antibodies that you have
from the vaccine are more likely to protect

00:03:02.900 --> 00:03:03.900
you from variants.

00:03:03.900 --> 00:03:06.940
And this means all of the major variants of
concern.

00:03:06.940 --> 00:03:08.200
The British variant.

00:03:08.200 --> 00:03:12.950
Of course, if you recovered from the British
