00:03:12.950 --> 00:03:13.999
the British variant.

00:03:13.999 --> 00:03:19.120
But big picture we have the British variant,
the Brazilian variant variant, the South African

00:03:19.120 --> 00:03:22.370
variant, California, New York, India.

00:03:22.370 --> 00:03:24.730
And there's probably more at this point in
time.

00:03:24.730 --> 00:03:30.159
It appears as though if you got covid and
recovered naturally, you are less protected

00:03:30.159 --> 00:03:33.299
